<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Reviews — The Fluent Edge</title>
<meta name="description" content="Every phrase you've missed, across every exercise, collected in one place to practice.">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>
<body>

<header class="site-header">
  <div class="container">
    <a class="wordmark" href="index.html">The Fluent <span class="slash">/</span> Edge</a>
    <div class="header-right">
      <nav class="site-nav">
        <a href="index.html">Exercises</a>
      </nav>
      <div id="profile-widget"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<div class="container exercise-header">
  <a class="back-link" href="index.html">&larr; Back to home</a>
  <span class="card-tag">Review</span>
  <h1>Reviews</h1>
  <p class="lead">Every phrase you've missed, across every exercise, collected in one place. Practice them here, or clear out the ones you've got down.</p>
</div>

<div class="container" id="reviews-root">

  <div id="reviews-signed-out" style="display:none;">
    <p class="review-empty">Sign in from the box in the top right to start building your review list — phrases you miss in any exercise will show up here automatically.</p>
  </div>

  <div id="reviews-empty" style="display:none;">
    <p class="review-empty">Nothing here yet. Phrases you get wrong in any exercise will show up here automatically — go <a href="index.html">practice an exercise</a> to get started.</p>
  </div>

  <div id="reviews-list-view" style="display:none;">
    <div class="review-toolbar">
      <span class="review-count" id="review-count"></span>
      <div class="review-toolbar-actions">
        <button class="btn btn-primary" type="button" id="btn-practice-reviews">Practice these</button>
        <button class="btn btn-wrong" type="button" id="btn-clear-reviews">Clear all</button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <ul class="review-list" id="review-list"></ul>
  </div>

  <div id="reviews-practice-view" style="display:none;">
    <a class="back-link" href="#" id="btn-back-to-list">&larr; Back to review list</a>
    <div class="practice-stage" id="practice-root">
      <div class="progress-label" data-progress-label></div>
      <div class="progress-track"><div class="progress-fill" data-progress-fill></div></div>
      <div data-stage></div>
      <div data-summary class="summary" style="display:none;"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

</div>

<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="container">
    <span>The Fluent Edge</span>
    <span>Reviews &middot; Everything you've missed, in one place</span>
  </div>
</footer>

<script src="js/profile.js"></script>
<script src="exercises/js/practice-engine.js"></script>
<script src="js/reviews.js"></script>
<script>
  FluentEdgeProfile.renderWidget(document.getElementById("profile-widget"));
</script>
</body>
</html>
